# Line endings: LF everywhere, declared rather than assumed.
#
# `core.autocrlf=input` currently keeps this clean on this machine, but it is a per-developer
# setting: a clone without it (or with `true`) would write CRLF into the worktree and commit it back
# in a mixed state. Declaring it here makes LF a property of the repository instead of a property of
# whoever happens to be checked out.
* text=auto eol=lf

